                            {
                                "example_id": "65bb18fb-ce0a-4147-8f14-6d3c836b88c7",
                                "sense_id": "f279a2d3-9b3d-3f1c-9e2b-b13d2ca7a966",
                                "text": "A black portmanteau, a black bag, a desk, a dressing-case, a brown-paper parcel, a hat-box, and an umbrella strapped to a walking-stick. It was all very dusty and fluey. I had our porter up to get under the bed and fetch it out; and though he habitually wallows in dust,--swims in it from morning to night, and wears a close-fitting waistcoat with black calimanco sleeves for the purpose,--it made him sneeze again, and his throat was that hot with it that it was obliged to be cooled with a drink of Allsopp's draft."
                            }
                        ]
